cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "clone-VPA: official implementation of CMA-VPA (Dynamic Latent Cloning with Continuous Barrier Guidance: Multi-Agent Vision-Predictor-Action)"
abstract: >-
  Official open-source implementation of CMA-VPA, a multi-agent extension of
  Vision-Predictor-Action: a PR-JEPA master that samples a joint mode over a
  quantized latent bus, clones with a K + 3 sequential decision chain and a
  conditional flow-matching action solver, and the CBF-DeGG-Flow safety layer
  (reciprocal high-order barrier shares, flow-time endpoint projection and
  knot-boundary projection), with Task T1 (multi-UAV antipodal crossing) and
  Task T2 (dual-arm tabletop assembly).
